# interplay_dag_chain_across_suspend: A chain over the root and children 1-8 and two tasks: its first nine nodes run, the tenth waits on the gate as well, and the eleven after it wait down the chain. The guest suspends (rvg_device_will_suspend quiesces every wait, rvg_device_finish_suspend drains) and resumes on a fresh device, which recreates the children (their nodes say running, docs/testing.md 6.24) and parses each held command again; the gate's NOP then releases the rest in order. Total order: interrupts and snapshots locked in order.
